{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CruyZTTXHz1793593792.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地金融監管部門分別召集銀行、證券及基金機構開會，研究優化股票回購增持再貸款政策，刺激A股主要指數半日升1%至2%。股評人連敬涵認為，相關舉措主要支持內地股市，對港股幫助輕微，之後要看政策如何落實，是否能夠挽回A股散戶信心。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:40:47.644346+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:38:10.172475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:38:10.172475+00:00","content_hash":"f359ad76f631a8660ce80d6c9322bd5de13ab45b09391f262cbb699cb59c7ce5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}